# Working in this repo

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/behaviour.md](../../docs/behaviour.md) before you edit.
- Follow "How a change happens" in the [project guide](../../AGENTS.md).
- Stay inside the current issue.
- Every change to how the assistant behaves must match [docs/behaviour.md](../../docs/behaviour.md). Do not write that behaviour in a second file.
